,title,link,text,language,family
0,Wao Terero - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wao_Terero,"Wao Terero, the Waorani (Huaorani) language, earlier also known as Sabela and Awishiri[3] (also Wao, Huao, Auishiri, Aushiri, Ssabela; pejorative: ""Auka"", ""Auca"" [3]), is a language isolate spoken by the Waorani people, an Indigenous people living in the Amazon rainforest between the Napo and Curaray Rivers in Ecuador.",Waorani,Language isolate
1,Waorani language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waorani_language,"The Waorani language, autonym: Wao Terero, earlier also known as Sabela and Awishiri, is a vulnerable language isolate spoken by the Waorani people, an Indigenous people living in the Amazon rainforest between the Napo and Curaray Rivers in Ecuador.",Waorani,Language isolate
2,"Waorani Language and the Huaorani Indian Tribe (Auca, Sabela...)",https://www.native-languages.org/waorani.htm,"Waorani Language (Auca, Sabela, Huaorani). Waorani is a language isolate of Ecuador not known to be related to any other living language. It is spoken by more than a thousand people in the Ecuadorian rainforest today.",Waorani,Language isolate
3,Waorani Phoneme Inventory — IPA Lookup,https://ipalookup.com/languages/waorani,Waorani (Language isolate) has 32 phonemes. Browse its full IPA sound inventory and compare it to other languages.,Waorani,Language isolate
4,Top Songs - Waorani Indians - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_kTcMceXqGwkaARo6axeGhwaMiK_BbNtOo,Waorani - The Amanita Muscaria Mix Astralasia - Topic 729 views • 10 years ago 6:30,Waorani,Language isolate
5,"Stream Waorani music | Listen to songs, albums, playlists for ...",https://soundcloud.com/wolfgrand,"Play Waorani and discover followers on SoundCloud | Stream tracks, albums, playlists on desktop and mobile.",Waorani,Language isolate
6,Waorani language and alphabet - Omniglot,https://www.omniglot.com/writing/waorani.htm,"Nov 9, 2023 · Waorani is also known as Huaorani, Sabela, Wao, Wao tededo, Huao, Auishiri, Aushiri or Ssabela, and Waorani speakers call it Wao Terero. There are three dialects: Tiguacuna, Tuei and Shiripuno.",Waorani,Language isolate
7,Rafael Diogo - Ancient Waorani icaro (Amazon rainforest),https://citiesandmemory.bandcamp.com/track/ancient-waorani-icaro-amazon-rainforest,"Sep 15, 2025 · This recording captures the early morning sounds of an ancient Waorani warrior in the Ecuadorian Amazon. Staying with him in his traditional palm-thatched longhouse, the tranquility of the environment was profound, with minimal external noise.",Waorani,Language isolate
8,Waorani Language (AUC) – L1 & L2 Speakers... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/auc/,Waorani is an endangered indigenous language of Ecuador. It is an isolate that is not known to be related to any other language. The language is used as a first language by some people in every generation of the ethnic community.,Waorani,Language isolate
9,Waorani language,https://grokipedia.com/page/Waorani_language,"The Waorani language, also known as Wao Tededo or Wao Terero, is classified as a language isolate, exhibiting no demonstrable genetic relationship to any other known language family in the Amazon basin or beyond.",Waorani,Language isolate
